=webp/https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/699176/xml-images/fnins-15-699176-g006.webp 1x, https://www.frontiersin.org/api/ipx/w=1224&amp;f=webp/https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/699176/xml-images/fnins-15-699176-g006.webp 2x, https://www.frontiersin.org/api/ipx/w=1836&amp;f=webp/https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/699176/xml-images/fnins-15-699176-g006.webp 3x" media="(max-width: 768px)"><source srcset="https://www.frontiersin.org/api/ipx/w=247&amp;f=webp/https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/699176/xml-images/fnins-15-699176-g006.webp 1x, https://www.frontiersin.org/api/ipx/w=494&amp;f=webp/https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/699176/xml-images/fnins-15-699176-g006.webp 2x, https://www.frontiersin.org/api/ipx/w=741&amp;f=webp/https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/699176/xml-images/fnins-15-699176-g006.webp 3x" media="(max-width: 1280px)"><source srcset="https://www.frontiersin.org/api/ipx/w=287&amp;f=webp/https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/699176/xml-images/fnins-15-699176-g006.webp 1x, https://www.frontiersin.org/api/ipx/w=574&amp;f=webp/https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/699176/xml-images/fnins-15-699176-g006.webp 2x, https://www.frontiersin.org/api/ipx/w=861&amp;f=webp/https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/699176/xml-images/fnins-15-699176-g006.webp 3x" media="(max-width: 1441px)"><source srcset="https://www.frontiersin.org/api/ipx/w=330&amp;f=webp/https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/699176/xml-images/fnins-15-699176-g006.webp 1x, https://www.frontiersin.org/api/ipx/w=660&amp;f=webp/https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/699176/xml-images/fnins-15-699176-g006.webp 2x, https://www.frontiersin.org/api/ipx/w=990&amp;f=webp/https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/699176/xml-images/fnins-15-699176-g006.webp 3x" media><source srcset="https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/699176/xml-images/fnins-15-699176-g006.webp" media><!--]--><img src="https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/699176/xm